{
  "notice": "All records are fully synthetic, assembled from curated word pools by a seeded random generator. First names are common US given names; surnames and school names are constructed blends verified absent from the US Census 2010 surname file, so no name describes a real person, school, or district. No real student data was used and no PII is present. Records are era-neutral: academic-year labels order the record but no year carries a real-world event, and rates and distributions are anchored to published national statistics from 2009 to 2025, so a record resembles no single school year. Values are random-rule-generated and not suitable for training ML models.",
